## solution

```js
const postOrder = (root) => {
  const values = [];
  postOrderTraversal(root, values);
  return values;
};

const postOrderTraversal = (root, values) => {
  if (root === null) return;
  postOrderTraversal(root.left, values);
  postOrderTraversal(root.right, values);
  values.push(root.val);
};
```

- n = number of nodes
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(n)

