## solution

```cpp
void postOrderTraversal(Node* root, std::vector<std::string> &values) {
  if (root == nullptr) {
    return;
  }

  postOrderTraversal(root->left, values);
  postOrderTraversal(root->right, values);
  values.push_back(root->val);
}

std::vector<std::string> postOrder(Node* root) {
  std::vector<std::string> values;
  postOrderTraversal(root, values);
  return values;
}
```

- n = number of nodes
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(n)
